sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as 客户端
    participant Handler as UserHandler
    participant Aspect as OperationLogAspect
    participant Service as UserService
    participant Queue as BlockingQueue阻塞队列
    participant Consumer as 消费者线程池
    participant LogService as OperationLogService
    participant Repo as OperationLogRepository
    participant MySQL as sys_operation_log表
    
    Note over Client,MySQL: 操作审计日志异步批量落库流程
    
    Client->>Handler: POST /admin-api/v1/users
    activate Handler
    
    Handler->>Aspect: AOP拦截 @OperationLog
    activate Aspect
    Note right of Aspect: 记录操作开始时间<br/>提取请求信息
    
    Aspect->>Service: createUser(request)
    activate Service
    Note right of Service: 执行业务逻辑<br/>数据库写入
    
    Service-->>Aspect: 返回UserDTO
    deactivate Service
    
    Aspect->>Aspect: 计算执行时间<br/>构建审计日志对象
    Note right of Aspect: operationTime<br/>executionTime<br/>requestParams<br/>responseResult
    
    Aspect->>Queue: 入队 offer(logEntity)
    activate Queue
    Note right of Queue: 异步队列<br/>容量10000<br/>非阻塞入队
    
    Aspect-->>Handler: 继续执行
    deactivate Aspect
    
    Handler-->>Client: 200 OK + UserDTO
    deactivate Handler
    
    Note over Queue,MySQL: 后台消费线程批量写入
    
    Consumer->>Queue: 批量取出 drainTo(batch, 100)
    activate Consumer
    Queue-->>Consumer: List<OperationLogEntity>
    deactivate Queue
    
    Consumer->>LogService: saveBatch(logList)
    activate LogService
    Note right of LogService: 批量保存<br/>最多100条/次
    
    LogService->>Repo: batchInsert(entities)
    activate Repo
    Note right of Repo: subscribeOn<br/>boundedElastic<br/>JDBC阻塞操作隔离
    
    Repo->>MySQL: INSERT INTO sys_operation_log VALUES (...)
    activate MySQL
    MySQL-->>Repo: 插入成功
    deactivate MySQL
    
    Repo-->>LogService: Mono<Void>
    deactivate Repo
    
    LogService-->>Consumer: 保存完成
    deactivate LogService
    deactivate Consumer
    
    Note over Client,MySQL: 关键设计
    Note over Aspect: AOP切面: 不阻塞主业务,异步入队
    Note over Queue: 阻塞队列: 生产者-消费者模式,削峰填谷
    Note over Consumer: 批量消费: 合并写入,降低DB压力
    Note over Repo: 线程隔离: JDBC操作调度到专用线程池
